/** 机库残骸（T099）：后山墙歪着还立着、门框剩两根柱子、门楣和推拉门拍在门口，拱顶一片片瓦楞板歪着叠在里面，几根断拱肋翘着 */
function hangarRuinParts(): PartSpec[] {
  const H = AIRFIELD.hangar;
  const R = H.w / 2;
  const ky = H.h / R;
  const r = seeded(77);
  const p: PartSpec[] = [
    { geo: new THREE.CircleGeometry(R, 20, 0, Math.PI).rotateY(HALF), color: 0x5a5852, pos: [H.d, 0, 0], scale: [1, ky * 0.8, 1], rot: [0, 0, 0.22] },
    { geo: box(0.5, 4.2, 0.6), color: 0x34322e, pos: [0, 2.1, -8.4], rot: [0.12, 0, 0.1] },
    { geo: box(0.5, 2.8, 0.6), color: 0x34322e, pos: [0, 1.4, 8.4], rot: [-0.2, 0, -0.08] },
    { geo: box(0.5, 0.5, 16.4), color: 0x2e2c2a, pos: [-1.4, 0.35, 0.4], rot: [0.05, 0.14, 0.12] },
    { geo: box(7.2, 0.3, 5.0), color: 0x55574f, pos: [-3.4, 0.3, -5.2], rot: [0.04, 0.18, 0.08] },
    { geo: box(6.8, 0.3, 5.0), color: 0x4c4e47, pos: [-2.2, 0.9, 2.0], rot: [0.3, -0.25, 0.2] },
  ];
  for (let i = 0; i < 9; i++) {
    p.push({ geo: box(5 + r() * 3, 0.16, 4.5 + r() * 2.5), color: [0x5c5c56, 0x4a4a46, 0x66665e, 0x3a3632][i % 4], pos: [2 + r() * (H.d - 3), 0.6 + r() * 2.6, (r() - 0.5) * (H.w - 4)], rot: [(r() - 0.5) * 0.9, r() * Math.PI, (r() - 0.5) * 0.9] });
  }
  for (const [x, flip, tilt] of [[5.6, 0, 0.25], [11, Math.PI, 0.35], [16.4, 0, 0.15]]) {
    p.push({ geo: new THREE.TorusGeometry(R, 0.2, 4, 8, Math.PI * 0.42).rotateY(-HALF), color: 0x3e3e3a, pos: [x, 0, 0], scale: [1, ky * 0.85, 1], rot: [tilt, flip, 0] });
  }
  for (let i = 0; i < 6; i++) p.push({ geo: box(1 + r() * 1.6, 0.6 + r(), 1 + r() * 1.4), color: 0x4a4440, pos: [2 + r() * (H.d - 4), 0.3, (r() - 0.5) * (H.w - 3)], rot: [r(), r() * 3, r()] });
  return p;
}

