/** 井架：钻台底座 + 四条往上收的腿 + 每 3.2 米一圈横撑、四面斜撑 + 天车 + 值班房 + 一排钻杆（原点在底座中间） */
function derrickParts(): PartSpec[] {
  const D = OIL.derrick;
  const RUST = 0xa06c3c;
  const p: PartSpec[] = [
    { geo: box(8, 0.2, 8), color: 0x8a7e6a, pos: [0, 0.1, 0] },
    { geo: box(7.4, 0.3, 7.4), color: 0x5a5650, pos: [0, 3.0, 0] },
    { geo: box(3.6, 2.6, 2.6), color: 0x7a7266, pos: [5.6, 1.3, 1.2] },
    { geo: box(3.7, 0.2, 2.7), color: 0x4e4a44, pos: [5.6, 2.7, 1.2] },
    { geo: box(2.2, 1.1, 2.2), color: 0x4e4a44, pos: [0, D.h + 0.5, 0] },
    { geo: box(1.4, 1.4, 1.2), color: 0x3a3632, pos: [0, 4.0, 0] },
  ];
  for (const [x, z] of [[-3, -3], [3, -3], [-3, 3], [3, 3]] as [number, number][]) {
    p.push({ geo: box(0.4, 2.9, 0.4), color: 0x4e4a44, pos: [x, 1.5, z] });
    p.push(strut([x, 3.1, z], [x * 0.25, D.h, z * 0.25], 0.3, RUST));
  }
  const w = (y: number) => 3 - 2.25 * ((y - 3.1) / (D.h - 3.1));
  const levels = [3.1, 6.3, 9.5, 12.7, 15.9, 19.1, D.h];
  for (let i = 0; i < levels.length; i++) {
    const y = levels[i];
    const h = w(y);
    for (const s of [-1, 1]) {
      p.push({ geo: box(h * 2, 0.16, 0.16), color: RUST, pos: [0, y, s * h] });
      p.push({ geo: box(0.16, 0.16, h * 2), color: RUST, pos: [s * h, y, 0] });
    }
    if (i === 0) continue;
    const y0 = levels[i - 1];
    const h0 = w(y0);
    // 四面斜撑（每面一根，方向交替）
    const f = i % 2 ? 1 : -1;
    p.push(strut([-h0 * f, y0, -h0], [h * f, y, -h], 0.12, RUST));
    p.push(strut([h0 * f, y0, h0], [-h * f, y, h], 0.12, RUST));
    p.push(strut([-h0, y0, h0 * f], [-h, y, -h * f], 0.12, RUST));
    p.push(strut([h0, y0, -h0 * f], [h, y, h * f], 0.12, RUST));
  }
  for (let i = 0; i < 4; i++) p.push({ geo: cyl(0.14, 0.14, 9, 6).rotateZ(HALF), color: 0x5e5a54, pos: [-0.5, 0.35 + (i % 2) * 0.26, 5.0 + i * 0.32] });
  return p;
}

